    "title": "pandas.Period.day — pandas 2.3.3 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.Period.day#\n\n- Period.day#\n- Get day of the month that a Period falls on. \n  - Returns:\n    - int\n See also \n  - `Period.dayofweek`\n  - Get the day of the week.\n  - `Period.dayofyear`\n  - Get the day of the year.\n Examples >>> p = pd.Period(\"2018-03-11\", freq='h') >>> p.day 11\n\nGet day of the month that a Period falls on.\n\nSee also\n\n`Period.dayofweek`\nGet the day of the week.\n\n`Period.dayofyear`\nGet the day of the year.\n\nExamples",
